|[[Wikia:monsterhunter:Vaal Hazak|Vaal Hazak]]
|Hazuku's Japanese name (オウルハズク ''Ōruhazuku'', "Owlhazuku") is somewhat similar to that of Vaal Hazak (ヴァルハザク ''Varuhazaku'', "Valhazak" or "Valhazaku").
