|[[Wikia:monsterhunter:Nargacuga|Nargacuga]]
| rowspan="3"|Similar Japanese name (ナマケモルガ ''Namakemoruga'') and attacks by firing spikes from its tail in the same way as Nargacuga. Its blue fur is reminiscent of Fiercewater Nargacuga from ''Monster Hunter Explore'', while its Freeze ability could be inspired by the Stun effect from Green Nargacuga's tail slam attack.
|-
|[[Wikia:monsterhunter:Fiercewater Nargacuga|Fiercewater Nargacuga]]
|-
|[[Wikia:monsterhunter:Green Nargacuga|Green Nargacuga]]
